[agent] ## How it was done
[agent] - Uploaded the two CSVs to UC volume `workspace.mlpab600b4f.airqdata`.
[agent] - Submitted a **serverless notebook job** (`mlpab600b4f_airq_pipeline`) that: read the data, engineered features into the feature group, materialized the training dataset, trained the regressor with a time-based 80/20 held-out split, logged metrics and registered the model to **Unity Catalog** via MLflow (`databricks-uc`), then predicted all 90 forecast rows into the predictions table. (First run failed on missing `mlflow`/`sklearn`; fixed by adding a `%pip install` cell.)
